Package: emu-root
Version: 1.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: heryandp <https://github.com/heryandp/rooted-android-x86-docker>
Depends: bash, curl, unzip, git, ca-certificates
Recommends: openjdk-17-jdk-headless, qemu-kvm, libpulse0, libgl1
Homepage: https://github.com/heryandp/rooted-android-x86-docker
Description: Rooted Android 12 Emulator (Play Store + Magisk) CLI launcher & installer
 emu-root provides a clean CLI launcher and automated AVD + Magisk rootAVD setup
 helper for running a rooted Android 12 (API 31) Google Play emulator on Ubuntu/Debian.
 After installation, run 'emu-root --setup' as your regular user to download the
 Android SDK, create Pixel_7_API_31_Rooted, and patch ramdisk.img with Magisk.
